sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as 🌐 Client
    participant NGINX as 🌐 NGINX
    participant Kong as 🚪 Kong
    participant TenantMW as 🏢 Tenant Middleware
    participant AuthMW as 🔐 Auth Middleware
    participant API as 🚀 Fastify Route
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL
    participant RLS as 🔒 RLS Policy

    Client->>NGINX: GET /api/oportunidades\nHost: acme.crm.com
    NGINX->>Kong: Forward
    Kong->>TenantMW: Resolve tenant
    TenantMW->>Kong: subdomain='acme'
    TenantMW->>DB: SELECT id FROM tenants WHERE subdominio='acme'
    DB-->>TenantMW: tenant_id = 'uuid-acme'
    TenantMW->>Kong: Set x-tenant-id header
    Kong->>AuthMW: Forward
    AuthMW->>AuthMW: Validate JWT/Cookie
    AuthMW->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = user_id AND tenant_id = 'uuid-acme'
    DB-->>AuthMW: user (role, activo)
    AuthMW->>API: Set request.user + request.tenantId
    API->>DB: SELECT set_tenant_context('uuid-acme')
    DB-->>RLS: SET LOCAL app.current_tenant_id = 'uuid-acme'
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM oportunidades WHERE pipeline_id = 'p1'
    RLS->>DB: Policy: tenant_id = current_setting('app.current_tenant_id')::uuid
    DB-->>API: Only acme's opportunities
    API-->>Client: 200 OK + data